    <title>为什么我给书房按键加了「长按开空调」</title>
    <link href="https://leepepe.github.io/thoughts/study-switch-long-press-ac/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <id>https://leepepe.github.io/thoughts/study-switch-long-press-ac/</id>
